###############################################################################

                       AutoSent Data File Cleaner V1.7T

###############################################################################





###############################################################################

                 REVIEW OF SENTCLEANER VERSIONS AND THEIR BUGS

###############################################################################

V1.0
        - Normal   Fast  Made  Programm  With Lots Of Bugs And No Shell Output.
          (never released)

V1.1
        - Like V1.0 (never released)

V1.2
        - Shell Release With Option Mode.  Option (1) Allowed (never released)

V1.3
        - Option (2,3 And 5) Added (never released)

V1.4
        - V1.3 BugFixed Version (never released)

V1.5
	- Option (LogSave) Added (never released)

V1.6
        - Shell/Icon Release.  Icon Included With Default Sentby (released)

V1.6 Turbo
        - Wb Runable.  Speed Release High Optimized (release)

V1.6 Turbo
        - Option (4) Added.  Different ToolType Sentby Allowed (released)

- Known Bugs!
        - The Programm Inserted An Escape Command To The Sent.Dat And This Also
          Posts  The  User  Number To The Dir Line (Only If Custom SentBy Made)
          This Is Fixed Now (released)

V1.7
	- The Future Versions Are All Turbo Releases!

- Known Bugs!
	- The  Programm  Does   Not  Run On An Non Speeded Amiga!  (Accelerator
          Card)  Because  The  Code  Was  Generated On An 040' And Wrote UnEven
          Bytes.   Thats  Why  The  Prg  Crashes  On A Normal Amiga.  Like 000'
          Because  You  Can't  Write UnEven Bytes On A Normal Amiga.  Bug Fixed
          Now It Should Work Everywhere.
	- Log Output Was A Bit Fucking Coded This Has Fixed Now!
	- If  No Icon Was Found The Message Internal Line Used!  But If An Icon
          Was Present Without ToolTypes The Programm Quited This Has Fixed Now!
          Now  A Messgae Comes And Let You Know That The Internal Line Was Used
          :)

###############################################################################





###############################################################################

                         REQUIREMENTS AND INSTALLATION

###############################################################################

     - A Normal Amiga With Os 2.x Or Higher ..............................
     - The Full Installed AmiExpress V3.32 Or Higher .....................
     - The Actual 'FileId, AutoSent' Package (From ByteAndi/Mystic).......
     - If You Wish 'UdCleaner' (From Empire/Mystic). To Use My Tool 100% .
     - Bbs:User.Data File ................................................
     - Doors:FileId/Sent.Dat File ........................................

                      You Must Copy This Archive Into The

                                 Doors:FileId

                           Directory And Thats All..

- You Can Run This Tool In Shell!  Just Enter The FileName

- You Are Able To Run This Tool In Wbmode!  Just Click On Its Icon.

- You   Are  Able  To Put This Util Into The Button Function Of AmiExpress.  If
  This  Is  What You Want (Hehe I Did This MySelf) Then Put These Lines In Your
  Acp Icon.

(-----------------------------------)
BUTTON_NAME.x=SentClean
BUTTON_COMMAND.x=Run >Nil: Doors:FileId/SentCleaner
(-----------------------------------)

###############################################################################





###############################################################################

                                    HISTORY

###############################################################################

Well  You Might Ask Why The Hell I Wrote This Util!  Ok Before I Explain How To
Use It I Will Tell You The Story.  Ok?

-  You  Got  'FileId'  And 'AutoSent' The Great Tools From ByteAndi/Mystic, But
   What Will Happen When You Delete Users?  Yeah The Handle Is Still Present In
   The Sent.Dat And Will Stay If Nothing Happens.

-  What Will Happen When You Use The Great 'UdCleaner' From Empire/Mystic Which
   Will  OverRun  (Sort)  Your  User.Data  And  Clean  It Up?  Yeah Allmost All
   SentBys Has To Be Created New Because They Are Not In Right Places AnyMore.

-  What  Is,  When Some Of Your Users Are Not Able, (How Ever The Reason Is) To
   Create A Sentby Yeah It Will Get On Yer Nerves..

This  Util  Will  Help  You  With  EveryThing.   Go  On  Reading  Now Comes The
Explainations And Examples.

###############################################################################





###############################################################################

            AN EXAMPLE WHAT UDCLEANER (EMPIRE/MYSTIC) IS ABLE TO DO
            SHORT INFO ABOUT THE EFFECT OF SENTCLEANER (GALAXY/TFA)

###############################################################################

               Sysop	=	1		(1 = UserNumber)
               MoFa	=	2		(2 = UserNumber)
               Rainer	=	3		(3 = UserNumber)

Rainer  Made  A  Sentby For 3 (Because Three Is His UserNumber) But What Happen
When I Delete MoFa And Use UdCleaner?  Yeah Rainer Will Become UserNumber 2 And
This  Means  The  AutoSent  Can't  Match The Location Of Rainer In The Sent.Dat
AnyMore.   Rainer Has To Write A New Sentby!  Isn't It A Shit Because You Sysop
Want  That All Users Use Sentby And That Poor Dude Thought That He Already Made
One  And  Then!!   EveryTime  A  New Question 'Enter Sentby...'!  What A Fuck..

- SentCleaner   Will  Place The Sentby To Its Correct Location.  Usefull If You
  Delete  Lots  Of  Lamers!   And Don't Want To Have Big UderDatas Or SentDatas
  (Only Effects If UdClean Was Used Before)

Note:
Fuck You All Sysops Who Are Realy Moterfucking Ill In Da Brains!  What The Hell
Are  You  Thinking  About  Users?   I  Got  Fucked  By An Ideot Because I Upped
Something  To  His  Unworthy  Board And Then He Nuked It 5 Times Because Of Not
Using AutoSent (Or Should I Say SentBy).  Well I Did This, I Made A SentBy Some
Days  Before  And  He  Probably  Deleted  The Sent.Dat Again (Lots Of Sysops Do
Because  They  Are  Silly  In Brain And Always Want To Install A New Version Of
AutoSent  Or  FileId  This  Causes  Them To Delete All old Stuff).  I Upped And
Pressed  'Go'  After  Upload  To  Go Sleeping..  Tztztz Fuck You All.  I Am Not
Behind That Stupid Few Bytes I Upped!

- Isn't   It  A  Fuck  That  Users  Seem Not To Be Able To Create A Sentby With
  AutoSent!   Yeah It Often Is And You Sysop Get Pissed Because That User Is To
  Stupid To Use AutoSent..  Well This Tool Is Able To Create Custom Sentbys For
  All Users And Is Also Able To Remove Them Again.

Note:
Such  A  Option Is Present In AutoSent (or Was It FileId??) Hehehehe But Anyway
This  Util  Can Create Different Styles And Thats Better.  Who The Fuck Wants A
Normal Line?  Better Use Styled (And Also Colored Lines!  If You Wish!)

###############################################################################





###############################################################################

                                 MENU OPTIONS

###############################################################################

                        1 = Clean Up 'Sent.Dat' Normaly

If  You  Use  This Option It Will CleanUp Your Sent.Dat To An Actual Length And
Will  Position All Created Sentbys Correctly If You Deleted A Lot Of Users.  It
Will  Cut  The  Sent.Dat  Down To An Actual Length.  (The Length Depends On The
Length  Of  The  User.Data)  (This  Option Only Effects When You Used UdCleaner
Before!)

###############################################################################

       2 = Clean Up 'Sent.Dat' And Add Custom Sentby For Missing Sentby

This  Is  The  Same  As  The First Option But Is Able To Add Custom Sentbys For
Users..   This  Will  Look Like The Line Showed Below (Continue Reading).  This
Option Will Add The User Name As Sentby With A Choosen Line For Example:

                             This Is A Custom Line

                   (--------------------------------------)

                         For User 'GALAXY' Will Become


                   (- GALAXY -----------------------------)

This  Is An Example!  Instead Galaxy There Will Be Present Every User Who Never
Made  A Sentby...  All Users Who Made A Sentby Before Will Keep Their Line (You
See  An  Intelligent  Option Hehehe) (You Might Run This Option Without Running
UdCleaner  First  Because  It  Creates The Custom Sentby So No Need To Wipe The
Users.   But  You Can If You Wish So The Effect Will Be A Sorted Sent.Dat And A
Cool Created SentBy For All Those Who Never Made one)

###############################################################################

               3 = Clean Up 'Sent.Dat' And Remove Custom Sentby

Ok  This  Option Is The Same As The Second Option.  If You Made Custom Sentbys,
This  Option  Is Able To Remove Them Again.  It Only Removes The Custom Sentbys
All Other Sentbys Which Are Not Made Customly Will stay..  (Intelligent Eh?)

###############################################################################

                        4 = Show Current Custon Sentby

This  Option  Let  You  See  The Actual Sentby Present In Memory You Can Define
Other Looking Sentbys If You Want.The Can Be Colored To.  These Lines Has To Be
Put Into The ToolTypes Of The Icon Which Should Be In:

                         Doors:FileId/SentCleaner.Info

    If No Icon Is Present It Takes The Default Sentby In Memory. (One Line)

Here An Example How An Icon Looks Like

TOOLTYPES:

LINES=x          (x = Number Of Lines [1-99])
SENTBY.x=y       (x = Number Of Sentby, Y = SentBy Line [1-99])

EXAMPLE:

LINES=2
SENTBY.1=(-------------------------------------------)
SENTBY.2=(===========================================)

###############################################################################

                          5 = Get Next Custom Sentby

With  This Option You Can Choose One Of The Sentby Defaults Which Where Located
In The Icon.  If No Icon Is Present This Option Has No Effect.

###############################################################################

                                   Q = Quit

This Option Speaks For ItSelf!

###############################################################################

                             L = Toggle Log On/Off

Press  'L'  Once  And A Log Will Be Opened.  Good If You Want To Check All Your
Users  With  'Type'  Or  'PpMore'.  So You Can Watch All Actions Closer Because
This Util Runs Real Fast And You Probably Can't See Everything Right Because Of
The Speed ;) (Or All The Users You Got!)

The Log Will Be Created In:

                             Doors:FileId/Sent.Log

Note:
Activating A Log Will Speed Up EveryThing Imediately!

###############################################################################

   So Thats All Folx Hope You Enjoy This Util! Soon More Options! (Updates)

                             Signed Galaxy/Tfa...

